Package: ZIM
Type: Package
Title: Zero-Augmented Integration Method for External Summary Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lu", "Deng", role = "aut"),
    person("Jun", "Zhong", role = "aut"),
    person("Xiaoyu", "Wang", role = "aut"),
    person("Laufey T.", "Amundadottir", role = "aut"),
    person("Kai", "Yu", email = "yuka@mail.nih.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Implements the Zero-Augmented Integration Method (ZIM) for
    integrating individual-level internal data with external regression
    coefficient estimates. Cohort and case-control implementations support
    common and different source populations, covariance estimation, and
    alternative weighting strategies.
